---
import GolfBall from './GolfBall.astro';
---
<section class="golf-escape" id="golf" aria-labelledby="golf-title">
  <picture class="golf-escape-photo">
    <img src="/assets/samanah-golf-atlas-2400.webp"
      srcset="/assets/samanah-golf-atlas-800.webp 800w, /assets/samanah-golf-atlas-1600.webp 1600w, /assets/samanah-golf-atlas-2400.webp 2400w"
      sizes="100vw" width="2400" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
      alt="Les greens et les bunkers du golf de Samanah, avec les sommets enneigés de l’Atlas à l’horizon" />
  </picture>
  <div class="golf-escape-layout">
    <div class="golf-escape-panel">
      <h2 id="golf-title">LE GOLF DE SAMANAH</h2>
      <span class="golf-escape-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Au pied de l’Atlas, le golf de Samanah déroule ses 18 trous dessinés par Nicklaus Design. Les greens, les bunkers et la végétation du domaine accompagnent la partie, avec les montagnes pour horizon.</p>
      <p>Depuis la villa, rejoignez le club-house en voiture. Après le parcours, retrouvez le calme du jardin et de votre piscine privée.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/voyage-golfique-a-marrakech/">Découvrir le parcours <GolfBall /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a class="golf-escape-credit" href="https://www.mysamanah.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Photo : Samanah Golf by Nicklaus</a>
</section>

<style>
  .golf-escape{position:relative;isolation:isolate;min-height:820px;margin-top:90px;background:#667459;color:#faf9f0}
  .golf-escape-photo{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;display:block;overflow:hidden}
  .golf-escape-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 59%}
  .golf-escape-layout{max-width:1800px;margin:0 auto;padding:100px 7.2% 110px}
  .golf-escape-panel{width:clamp(510px,42vw,660px);padding:70px clamp(45px,4.5vw,85px);background:#71745e}
  .golf-escape-panel h2{font:400 24px/1.6 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.12em;color:inherit}
  .golf-escape-rule{display:block;width:100px;height:1px;background:currentColor;margin:34px 0 40px;opacity:.85}
  .golf-escape-panel p{font:400 19px/1.9 var(--sans);color:inherit}
  .golf-escape-panel p+p{margin-top:22px}
  .golf-escape-panel .text-link{margin-top:34px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;border-color:#faf9f099;gap:24px;color:inherit}
  .golf-escape-credit{position:absolute;right:30px;bottom:22px;max-width:calc(100% - 60px);font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;text-align:right;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 6px #000b}
  .golf-escape-credit:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}
  @media(min-width:1800px){.golf-escape{min-height:980px}.golf-escape-layout{padding-top:140px;padding-bottom:140px}}
  @media(max-width:1000px){
    .golf-escape-layout{padding:75px 5% 100px}
    .golf-escape-panel{width:510px;max-width:75%;padding:50px 40px}
    .golf-escape-panel h2{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.09em}
    .golf-escape-photo img{object-position:61% center}
  }
  @media(max-width:700px){
    .golf-escape{min-height:0;margin-top:55px;padding-top:290px}
    .golf-escape-photo{height:440px}
    .golf-escape-photo img{object-position:67% 67%}
    .golf-escape-layout{padding:0 20px 36px}
    .golf-escape-panel{width:auto;max-width:none;padding:35px 28px}
    .golf-escape-panel h2{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:.08em}
    .golf-escape-rule{width:74px;margin:25px 0 28px}
    .golf-escape-panel .text-link{gap:15px;margin-top:28px}
    .golf-escape-credit{position:static;display:block;padding:0 25px 25px;max-width:none;text-align:left;text-shadow:none}
  }
</style>
